    choice wins). CLASSIFIER PATH: when the classifier (021) resolves a type for a chat-started review that gets
    promoted to an Analysis, write the sprk_agreementtype lookup so persistence matches routing (the wizard path's
    write shipped with hub A1).
  </prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Routing policy, Dataverse writes via authenticatedFetch/webApi shim.</role>
  <goal>Explicit subDomain always wins and binds without classification; classifier-resolved types persist to the Analysis lookup; mismatch = warn-only.</goal>

